ize: calc(var(--scale-factor)*8.04px); font-family: sans-serif;">•</span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*19.54px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*260.08px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*8.04px); font-family: sans-serif;"> </span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*22.32px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*259.30px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.00px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.98674);">Call for contribution</span></span><span class="markedContent" id="page3R_mcid10"><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*36.48px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*118.81px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(1.00606);">Quarterly newsletter</span></span><span class="markedContent" id="page3R_mcid11"><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*121.85px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*157.59px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.957362);">Welcome to the first issue of the Klassischer Indischer Tanz e.V‘s</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*121.85px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*168.87px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.97152);">quarterly newsletter Nritya Vani: the voice of dance.</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*121.85px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*180.27px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.984681);">This is a space for keeping up to date with the goings on in the</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*121.85px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*191.55px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.975967);">Verein and keep our growing community of members</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*121.85px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*202.95px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.968803);">continuously informed, engaged, and enable collaboration.</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*121.85px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*214.23px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.977369);">In this issue, we give you a glimpse into KITD’s 2024 and</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*121.85px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*225.63px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.980192);">information on our board members. You can also contribute in</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*121.85px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*236.91px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.975651);">the newsletter</span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*182.35px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*236.91px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif;"> </span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*185.45px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*236.91px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif;">-</span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*188.77px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*236.91px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif;"> </span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*191.81px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*236.91px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.992995);">read on to find out how :)</span></span><span class="markedContent" id="page3R_mcid12"><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*121.85px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*258.27px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.988431);">On behalf of the board, we wish you lots of dance in 2025!</span></span><span class="markedContent" id="page3R_mcid13"><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*229.27px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*118.81px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(1.01788);">Volume 1</span></span><span class="markedContent" id="page3R_mcid14"></span><span class="markedContent" id="page3R_mcid15"></span><span class="markedContent" id="page3R_mcid16"><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*39.26px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*312.88px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*12.00px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(1.06856);">A Year that Established Indian Classical Dance in Germany</span></span><span class="markedContent" id="page3R_mcid17"><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*38.54px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*531.78px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.985102);">2024 marked the beginning of KITD’s</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*38.54px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*543.06px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.979199);">initiative to bring Indian classical</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*38.54px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*554.46px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.961285);">dance to Germany in a collaborative</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*38.54px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*565.74px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.969076);">and holistic manner.</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*38.54px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*577.14px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.961385);">With performances and workshops</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*38.54px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*588.42px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.972043);">spanning the country, the association</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*38.54px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*599.82px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.995452);">laid the groundwork for a region</span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*178.13px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*599.82px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif;">-</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*38.54px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*611.10px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.979253);">focused approach, dividing its efforts</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*38.54px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*622.50px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.971235);">into four sectors: east, west, north,</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*38.54px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*633.78px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.962014);">and south.</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*38.54px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*645.06px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.943335);">In May,</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*71.66px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*644.62px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*10.50px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.898931);">You Slay Girl</span><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*125.93px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*645.06px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.957113);">, a musical theatre</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*38.54px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*656.46px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.965729);">production addressing sexual violence</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(var(--scale-factor)*38.54px); top: calc(var(--scale-factor)*667.74px); font-size: calc(var(--scale-factor)*9.96px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(0.962349);">and abuse, was staged in Frankfurt</span><br role="presentation"><span role="presentation" dir="ltr" style="left: calc(va