d Receipt</span><div class="wms_settings_chckbx"><label class="wms_settings_label" for="wms_settings_read_receipt">Enable read receipt for conversations</label><label class="wms_toggle_switch"><input checked="" id="wms_settings_read_receipt" data-setting="read_receipt" type="checkbox"><span data-type="custom" class="wms_settings_togglebuttonsel"></span></label></div></div><div id="wms_settings_lastseen" class="wms_settings_general"><span class="wms_settings_header">Last seen </span><div class="wms_settings_chckbx"><label class="wms_settings_label" for="wms_settings_show_lastseen">If disabled, you'll not be able to see the last seen of any of your contacts.</label><label class="wms_toggle_switch"><input id="wms_settings_show_lastseen" data-setting="show_lastseen" type="checkbox"><span data-type="custom" class="wms_settings_togglebutton"></span></label></div></div><div id="wms_settings_translation" class="wms_settings_general" data-translation-feature="enabled" style=""><div class="wms_settings_header"><span>Language Translation</span><label class="wms_toggle_switch"><input id="wms_settings_showtranslation" data-setting="messagetranslation" type="checkbox"><span data-type="custom" class="wms_settings_togglebutton"></span></label></div><div class="wms_translation_settings" data-expanded="false"><div class="wms_select_translation" style="display: none"><select class="wms_translation_select" id="translationpermission" data-select="translationpermission"><option id="wms_settings_manualtranslation" value="1" data-value="1" name="translation" data-setting="manual_translation">Manual Translation</option><option id="wms_settings_autotranslation" name="translation" data-setting="auto_translation" value="2" data-value="2">Automated Translation</option></select><span class="wms_settings_openicon"></span></div></div></div><div id="zoho_links_privacy" class="wms_settings_general"><span class="wms_settings_header">Configure privacy for zoho links</span><div id="wms_zoholinks_settin